.com&oh=00_AfviOM1P-7GQw15Pa6TXN441KLpc2-hOhNHHAiW_xp80uw&oe=69A444D3"}, {"file_name": "com.EngineRoomVRLLC.GGVR_FoF-20250724-091611.png", "id": "572298672487295", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_572298675820628_1482399442038117872_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ro4O0Adq26YQ7kNvwFbUlau&_nc_oc=Adm7BAwXmD-0gstleZfZDrDpE-ahla5e4_t-WSZrsbmkWikbKdVM2X8ifkXcwE7y_bM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuGgbKQEYW_kG8n9zWzM5iKP1wK_KO-KaEytqi27kZ2bA&oe=69A45127"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "tempImagevrcn8k.png", "id": "1443243466866064", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820983_1443243470199397_32396993155886215_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uApASJ1NIOkQ7kNvwFHDy7X&_nc_oc=Adn1LDjXv_xX9RTg-N7R6y2Gyk9PzVhm5aOGhZYj1CUjH8mMxvRp1Glv1NRSwGFS2tI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuOru-OzsgkFmZ0FZmhzt9nUJ9oAvZSei4nyiyHQh9VpQ&oe=69A43B2C"}, "display_name": "Fists of Fury", "keywords": ["Boxing", "Fight", "Punch", "Box", "Fitness"], "long_description": "Ready to throw punches, build real technique, boost your fitness, and break a serious sweat?\nStep into the ring with \u201cFists of Fury\u201d \u2014 the viral Golden Gloves mini game, now unleashed as a full standalone experience!\n\nEarly Access includes 4 unique venues, customizable speed settings, and progressive levels designed to sharpen your skills and push you up the leaderboards.\n\nUnlike rhythm-based games, Fists of Fury is built as a true boxing tool \u2014 helping you master punch transitions, timing, and proper technique as you train like a fighter.\n\nGloves on. Game on. Are you ready to throw down?", "short_description": "Step into the ring and rise through the ranks in \u201cFists of Fury\u201d \u2014 the viral Golden Gloves mini game, now a standalone experience!\nEarly Access features 4 dynamic venues, adjustable speed settings, and multiple